OL,3,GNEWSAHow could thousands of new homes
OL,4,Aaffect market town?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic market town could see its
OL,7,Fpopulation rise by as much as 70% after
OL,8,Fplans for up to 3,200 new homes were
OL,9,Fapproved.
OL,11,FAs well as new houses, the Growing
OL,12,FBaldock project promises employment,
OL,13,Fleisure and education facilities.
OL,15,FOpponents say it will ruin a historic
OL,16,Ftown and affect life in nearby
OL,17,Fvillages.
